## The edge

Traffic reaches services through **Traefik**, not nginx: `install_nginx` is
`{{ install_nginx | default(false) | lower }}` and host nginx is an opt-in
fallback only. Service hostnames are `<service>.{{ tenant_domain }}`, gated by
Authentik forward-auth or native OIDC depending on the service.

Do not advise restarting nginx. If a route misbehaves, look at Traefik and at
the service's own auth mode.

